graph TD
    A[Pyruvate Accumulation] --> B{Oxygen Availability?}
    B -->|Low| C[Anaerobic Conditions]
    B -->|High| D[Aerobic Respiration]
    
    C --> E[Pyruvate Decarboxylase]
    E --> F[Acetaldehyde Formation]
    F --> G[Alcohol Dehydrogenase]
    G --> H[Ethanol Production]
    H --> I[NAD+ Regeneration]
    I --> J[Fermentation Complete]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    C --> K[Lactate Dehydrogenase]
    K --> L[Lactate Production]
    L --> M[NAD+ Regeneration]
    M --> J
    
    %% Regulation
    J --> N[Energy Status]
    N --> O{Oxygen Available?}
    O -->|Yes| P[Respiration Switch]
    O -->|No| Q[Fermentation Continuation]
    
    %% Key proteins
    R[Pyruvate Decarboxylase] --> E
    S[Alcohol Dehydrogenase] --> G
    T[Lactate Dehydrogenase] --> K
    U[NAD+] --> I
    V[NADH] --> I
    W[Acetaldehyde] --> F
    X[Ethanol] --> H
    Y[Lactate] --> L
    
    %% Styling
    style A fill:#ffd1d1
    style B fill:#bbdefb
    style C fill:#f4a261
    style D fill:#c8e6c9
